{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0504_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "32536822e2118b2f86d711729a8914624b71b00d8e5a894bf81cc37e8c7d55f7", "ja": "ふふ、言葉も出ないくらい見惚れちゃった？\nいつもと違うアタシに。うふふ……。", "zh": "呵呵，看我看得入迷到连话都说不出来了？\n因为和平时不一样的我。呜呼呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
