{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0504_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "12e81a2901d772edce5a63d72a4f09798f9a4301343f009ed802a2f1e139a2b7", "ja": "マイガーッ！　は、恥ずかしい～！\nアタシ、ノリノリで喋っちゃったよ～！", "zh": "天哪——！好、好害羞～！\n我刚才太来劲了，一不小心说得兴奋过头了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
