{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0504_1008_p", "source_sha256": "00aba56a9e2528799cd0f596c9208c9af22530aad0df6a2a4d6b9920c64c16c1", "ja": "それにしても、あの喋り方はどうしたんだ？\nセクシーを意識してたのは、なんとなくわかるけど。", "zh": "不过话说回来，你刚才那种说话方式是怎么回事？\n虽然我大概能看出来，你是在有意识地展现性感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0504_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a8bcbd83f001535da0475caac1f404a6e046c4916e5ca5ed1e932070b17fd1fa", "ja": "あー、えっと……セクシーの練習、みたいな？", "zh": "啊——那个……像是在练习性感，之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
